WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.070
Here is Curtis's method,
caught in the act.

2
00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:07.820
In a Piegan Lodge shows Little Plume
and his son Yellow Kidney, of the Piegan,

3
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.970
or Blackfeet, seated in a lodge.

4
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.270
On the left is the original
glass-plate negative,

5
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.730
from about 1910.

6
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.970
Between the two men
sits an ordinary clock.

7
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.730
On the right is the version
Curtis published.

8
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.030
The clock has been retouched away.

9
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:24.970
Why erase a clock?

10
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.870
Because it shows people living
in the twentieth century,

11
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.970
which is exactly what the vanishing
story could not allow.
